  <ColonyCouncil.TownPlanDef>
    <defName>Rimfolk_Plan_VaultDoor</defName>
    <label>Sunken Vault&apos;s door</label>
    <description>The Sunken Vault's door: the vault itself behind a wall of plasteel, its door kept shut, with the dwellers' bunks, the console that still talks to nobody, the batteries that keep the last of the lights on and the stores of what still works; and outside it the surface camp growing round the door, bedrolls round two fires, a potato field and a fence against the open ground.</description>
